ing: no duplication and one source → the single-source-of-truth rule; cross-references → Style + the CI guard; hierarchy → `docs/README.md`; no stale info → Status honesty. *(4) An explicit six-condition Definition of Done*, with the note that reporting done with documentation outstanding is reporting done falsely. Also added the missing **user-visible behaviour** row to the change-type table, distinguishing a presentation change from a process change. **`CLAUDE.md`** gained the before/during/after steps and the six-condition Done (it is the file read every session, so the *before* step has to live there); **`docs/development/README.md`**'s working agreement gained the read-first step as item 2, renumbered, and now closes with the Definition of Done. **Verified:** 532 links across 46 files resolve (up from 518 — all new anchors included), ten guards green, 102 + 48 tests green, lint and typecheck clean. |
