ut of the *calendar* but an association must be able to enrol before opening day. Written on the **applicant only**, never copied onto the child. **Verified live end-to-end**, not assumed: two registrations into two different branches; the queue showed each requested branch; `?branch_id=` returned exactly 1 and 1 with `meta.total` following the filter; the family-link item showed *(none)* unfiltered and was excluded when filtering; missing/unknown/soft-deleted branch and a stray `level_id` all returned **400**; approving reported `records_updated: 2` and left **0 role rows and 0 enrolments** — the branch is a request, and approval still grants no placement. Fixtures removed afterwards | New CI guard `check-migration-order.sh` (12 guards); `BranchSelector` promoted to §14.3's shared registry | `20260801194116_r39_user_intended_branch` — nullable FK, `ON DELETE RESTRICT`, partial index over pending rows |
